sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as Assigner (Ch 40)
    participant UI as Screen
    participant Pipe as Analytics (Ch 82)
    participant Backend as Analyzer + guardrails

    User->>App: open experiment screen
    App->>App: variant = hash(stableId + expId) < fraction ? B : A - deterministic/sticky
    App->>UI: render variant (A or B)
    UI->>Pipe: log EXPOSURE (expId, variant) when actually shown - PII-safe (Ch 28)
    User->>UI: converts / engages
    UI->>Pipe: log OUTCOME (primary metric)
    Pipe->>Backend: exposure + outcome events (Ch 82)
    Backend->>Backend: measure primary effect and significance, check guardrails (crash Ch 83, latency Ch 85)
    Backend-->>App: guardrail breach -> kill variant via remote config (Ch 40/41)
    Backend-->>App: significant lift + guardrails ok -> ramp to 100 percent (ship)
